## Program Outcome

The fleet dashboard provides fast, accessible, URL-backed discovery across privacy-bounded reported
project and artifact fields, with explainable operational filtering and ordering.

## M1-BOUNDED-SEARCH — Define and implement fleet discovery

Status: active
Depends on: none

Outcome: Search existing hosted project and lifecycle inventory without indexing private or
unbounded local content.

Gate:

- `G1-BOUNDED-CROSS-PROJECT-SEARCH`: allowlisted fields only, bounded query/result behavior, and
  no document bodies, prompts, paths, commands, diagnostics, credentials, or hidden local content.

Candidate campaign: `implement-cross-project-dashboard-search-and-operator-views`.

## M2-OPERATOR-VIEWS-WORK2 — Present and qualify stable views

Status: active
Depends on: M1

Outcome: Deliver stable filter URLs, explainable recent-activity order, compact result context,
accessible navigation, bounded pagination, and configured-target verification.

Gates:

- `G2-STABLE-OPERATOR-FILTERS`: controlled filters, visible active state, clear/reset, result count,
  and preserved recent-activity ordering.
- `G3-ACCESSIBLE-BOUNDED-PRESENTATION`: keyboard, narrow-screen, pagination, query-count, response,
  and browser behavior pass.

Candidate campaign: `implement-cross-project-dashboard-search-and-operator-views`.

