## Work2 Boundary

Work2 includes the bounded search/filter implementation, focused privacy/query/rendering/navigation
tests, quick changed-path validation, scoped product commit, deployment to the combined
`ts.rookaro.com` target, authenticated browser and health checks, release-cohort registration,
logical checkpoint/rebuild proof, and strict Doctor.

Work2 does not push Git, tag or publish a version, add saved-view preference storage, or close the
Idea, Map, PRM, or Campaign. Those await formal Work5 release evidence and reconciliation.
